  "description": "Reusable Playwright screenshot test pattern for ASP.NET Core apps, including animation filmstrip capture. Wires up a deterministic, CI-friendly UI screenshot suite in ~50-100 lines of project-specific code.",
  "id": "Surfshack.Screenshots.Testing",
